# Python bytecode. erify_engine.py and the Hermes plugin are Python, so running either
# produces these next to the source. They are build output, they differ per interpreter
# version, and a .pyc in a repository is one of the signals that a project was never
# published with care.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
